                    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) about GIF to JPG</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-list">
                    <div class="faq-item">
                        <h3>Is my data secure when converting GIF to JPG?</h3>
                        <p>Yes, completely. All conversion calculations are done locally in your browser using HTML5 Canvas and File Reader APIs. Your files are never uploaded to any server, so your photos remain private.</p>
