                    <li><strong>2. Instant Conversion:</strong> The tool automatically reads the files. Click "Convert" to transform them using your web browser's native API.</li>
                    <li><strong>3. Download JPG:</strong> Click download on each file card, or download everything as a single ZIP file. It is that simple, secure, and fast!</li>
                </ol>
            </div>

